zS&_nc_oc=AdrSpqbP0tkLVOJAUJ0x0D3jFGhFIWWkV85o4mG5yNcSb6R07tVEbCqhJpZnb9WrH_0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNuSB2-APmrjfQUX7SQIpD6Rf6JLPvTWchGHVMD5XBnLA&oe=6ACF9E26"}, "display_name": "Cat Shop Simulator: Meow Mart", "keywords": ["simulator", "cat", "job", "animal", "shop"], "long_description": "# \ud83d\ude3a Run a Cat Supermarket  \nOpen the doors, fill the shelves, scan the items, and take the money. Work fast, work slow, run a clean little shop, or turn it into a busy cat-powered market. It is your store.\n\n{1045852744450130}\n\n# \ud83d\ude3a Breed Cats  \nPut two cats together and see what kind of kitten you get. Keep the cute ones, sell the valuable ones, or try again for a rare coat. Your cat family is your business.\n\n{940964898933813}\n\n# \ud83d\ude3a Collect Every Coat  \nEvery cat color has a spot in your Tablet. Find a new coat, light it up, and keep going until the whole page is full.\n\n\n# \ud83d\ude3a Hire Cat Employees  \nCats can work too. Put them in your store and let them help you earn money. But cats will not work for free forever. If they get too tired, they may run away.\n\n{1003501435637679}\n\n# \ud83d\ude3a Scratch Lottery Tickets  \nSell tickets to customers, or scratch them yourself. Play it safe and make steady money, or chase the lucky ticket that could make your day.\n\n{1329591069307677}\n\n# \ud83d\ude3a Keep Your Favorite Cats  \nKeep your favorite cats in special Cat Zones. Let them walk around, rest, and stay near you while you work. Sell the others, keep the best, or try to collect them all.\n\n# \ud83d\ude3a Expand Your Supermarket  \nBuy more products, make your store bigger, and upgrade your shop. Build a small cozy store, a busy supermarket, or the biggest Meow Mart on the block.\n\nJoin our Discord and become a Shareholder \u2014 vote on what we build next! https://discord.gg/at5QaPDjvg\n\n", "short_description": "Run your own cat supermarket in VR!\n\nStock shelves, scan items, serv