st supermarket ever! **Meow Mart** blends immersive first-person shop management with an addictive cat breeding system. \n\n![Restocking and Store Expansion]{1045852744450130}\n\n\ud83d\uded2 **Immersive First-Person Management**\nExperience the tactile satisfaction of running a store! Unlock a massive variety of products to fill your shelves. Physically restock items, ring up customers, and manage your daily profits. Earn money to expand your floor plan, turning your small shop into the ultimate bustling mega-mart.\n\n\ud83d\udc08 **Breed & Collect 30 Feline Variations**\nStart your feline empire with **6 distinct breeds and 30 beautiful coat variations**! Master the breeding economics: carefully plan your pairings (males breed 5x, females 3x) to hatch new kittens, unlock them all, and complete your ultimate feline collection!\n\n![Cat Breeding and Hatching]{940964898933813}\n\n\u2728 **Strategic Pet Economy & Collection**\nYour cats are valuable assets! Sell them for massive profits to fund your store expansions and unlock even more goods, or keep your absolute favorites in 4 designated \"Cat Zones\" (holding up to 40 cats). Watch them interact in your store and enjoy their cozy companionship while you work!\n\n\ud83c\udfe0 **The Giant Rooftop Cat**\nStep outside and look up! A massive, sleeping giant cat rests on your roof. It's the ultimate cozy landmark for your retail empire.\n\nPut on your headset, grow your business, and build your dream Meow Mart today!\n\n", "short_description": "Put on your VR headset and run your very own Meow Mart! Experience the immersive fun of first-person restocking and cashiering. Launching with 6 distinct cat breeds\u2014breed them freely, sell them for a profit, or keep them as collectibles in your store to boost customer traffic. Enjoy the ultimate cozy blend of shop management and virtual cat petting!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.meowmartvr.com/PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_o